@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Continuous integration (.github/workflows/ci.yml)

start
:pull request or push to main;
:**changes**
detect the affected modules (paths-filter);
fork
  :**build** (one job per affected service)
  ./mvnw -pl <service> -am verify
  docker build;
  if (push to main?) then (yes)
    :push ghcr.io/rentporto/<service>
    tagged with the commit;
  else (no)
  endif
fork again
  :**contracts**
  AsyncAPI lint
  common-events and common-messaging tests;
fork again
  :**compose**
  docker compose up --wait
  ./infra/verify.sh;
fork again
  :**kubernetes**
  kubeconform (Kubernetes 1.33)
  check-manifests.sh (probes, limits);
end fork
:**CI result**
the only required check on main;
stop
@enduml
